{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49542","headline":"清平乐 二 · 尹鹗","name":"清平乐 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳年妙妓，淡拂铅华翠。\n轻笑自然生百媚，争那尊前人意。\n酒倾琥珀杯时，更堪能唱新词。\n赚得王孙狂处，断肠一搦腰肢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}